 :question/worked-solution "To solve for $c,$ we apply the average value formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{\\text{avg}} & =\\frac{1}{b-a}{\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ 7 & =\\frac{1}{c-0}{\\int }_{0}^{c}(24{x}^{2}+20x+4)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ 7 & ={\\frac{1}{c}(8{x}^{3}+10{x}^{2}+4x)|}_{0}^{c} \\\\ 7 & =\\frac{1}{c}[(8{c}^{3}+10{c}^{2}+4c)-0] \\\\ 7 & =8{c}^{2}+10c+4 \\\\ 0 & =8{c}^{2}+10c-3 \\\\ 0 & =(2c+3)(4c-1) \\\\ c & =-\\frac{3}{2},\\,\\frac{1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $c>0,$ we conclude that $c=\\frac{1}{4}$ only." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-32499d7d-98ec-5c26-b24c-0196cd9865ef"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-32499d7d-98ec-5c26-b24c-0196cd9865ef" :answer-field/id #uuid "32499d7d-98ec-5c26-b24c-0196cd9865ef" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-32a1e531-1ccd-5a93-b077-640516633b66" :answer-field/choices ["answer-55d8a23c-b830-57d0-a5c7-64f48c868528" "answer-ada54ccc-dafd-57ee-a1f0-3847e2e0224c" "answer-fcd390d4-2d1d-5cf8-8e2d-09168ddad98c" "answer-30d4cfcd-4ddc-537e-b949-5338d53ece3f" "answer-32a1e531-1ccd-5a93-b077-640516633b66"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-55d8a23c-b830-57d0-a5c7-64f48c868528" :answer/id #uuid "55d8a23c-b830-57d0-a5c7-64f48c868528" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ada54ccc-dafd-57ee-a1f0-3847e2e0224c" :answer/id #uuid "ada54ccc-dafd-57ee-a1f0-3847e2e0224c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fcd390d4-2d1d-5cf8-8e2d-09168ddad98c" :answer/id #uuid "fcd390d4-2d1d-5cf8-8e2d-09168ddad98c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-30d4cfcd-4ddc-537e-b949-5338d53ece3f" :answer/id #uuid "30d4cfcd-4ddc-537e-b949-5338d53ece3f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :a